    "Two practical consequences follow for the reader. First, anything circulating elsewhere about Pryhmex without a source, an age, a precise origin, a style described in superlatives, should be read with caution: as of October 20, 2026, the verifiable public file fits into one collective record, one festival date and a full name given by BuzzDA. Second, this profile is built to grow: if the artist publishes a solo record, an artist page or a biography, the page will be completed and dated, like every page on this site.",
    "In the meantime, the listening is simple and short: the “Up Next Bouyon Cypher, Vol. 1”, in full, because that is where, and only where, the voice of Pryhmex is documented, alongside those of <a href=\"/en/trilla-g.html\">Trilla-G</a>, <a href=\"/en/gz-up.html\">G’z Up</a> and <a href=\"/en/ras-b.html\">Ras B</a>, whose profiles this site publishes in the same wave. The context of the genre is read on our <a href=\"/en/bouyon-soca.html\">bouyon soca</a> page, which recalls the lineage of the sound, from the bouyon soca started by Dada in 2003 in Dominica, per the first hand testimony of Smokiller, to the 2026 next generation this cypher puts on stage."
